[{"slug":"cba","featured":true,"headline":"The WNBA and players have a new contract. Here’s what it means for the Lynx.","dek":null,"date":"March 2026","link":"https://www.startribune.com/minnesota-lynx-wnba-cba-napheesa-collier-salary-cap-free-agents/601619749?utm_source=gift","publication":null,"img":null,"alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, Layercake, Reporting","tags":"graphics & data"},{"slug":"diggins","featured":false,"headline":"In Lake Placid, Jessie Diggins’ swan song","dek":"How does one visualize the career of America's greatest cross-country skier? I built a scrolly tracker, sized proportionally to the total (solo) kilometers Diggins has skied professionally, assembled with data from her FIS page. The 4,000+ km she skied doesn't mean much without context, so we added little anchors to help orient a Minnesota audience in that distance. And, even though it's not about the medals – Diggins' words – she has a lot of them! As you scroll, you can see just how many she accumulated throughout her career. ","date":"March 2026","link":"https://www.startribune.com/jessie-diggins-cross-country-skiing-retirement-world-cup-lake-placid/601599579?utm_source=gift","publication":null,"img":null,"alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Python, Reporting, Svelte, Javascript","tags":"design"},{"slug":"vonn","featured":true,"headline":"Five mountains (and one hill) that defined Lindsey Vonn's career","dek":"Lindsey Vonn is a dominant alpine skier – and a proud Minnesotan export. I designed this piece with a colleague to see just how much she's impacted the sport in the leadup to her final Olympics.","date":"February 2026","link":null,"publication":null,"img":null,"alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, D3","tags":"design"},{"slug":"jefferson","featured":true,"headline":"From the Gridiron to the Met Gala","dek":"They say you can spot Justin Jefferson's chains from the nosebleeds at US Bank stadium. While that isn't true (I tried), it is true that the wide receiver has style. I collaborated with my friend and Vikings reporter Emily Leiker to dissect some of Jefferson's most iconic outfits.","date":"December 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/justin-jefferson-minnesota-vikings-fashion-vogue/601367081?utm_source=gift","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":null,"alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, Reporting","tags":"design"},{"slug":"rcv","featured":true,"headline":"How does ranked-choice voting work?","dek":"Minneapolis municipal elections use ranked choice voting to select City Council, Park Board and mayor. The Star Tribune has done an explainer on how the process works, and I had the privilege of getting to reinvision the explainer for the 2025 election. To help explain how the process works to our audience, I wanted to take a look at the election results from 2017 – the last municipal election where there was a strong possibility of an incumbent being unseated. ","date":"October 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/how-does-ranked-choice-voting-work/601489217?utm_source=gift","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/rcv-1.gif","alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, After Effects, Layercake","tags":"graphics & data"},{"slug":"voterguide25","featured":true,"headline":"A guide to the 2025 Minneapolis city election","dek":"One of the most important functions of a local newsroom is disseminating information to voters. I designed the guide for Minneapolis' 2025 municipal election, which presented answers to key questions from almost everyone running. My favorite part? The homemade map component to help readers orient which ward/park district they were in. ","date":"September 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/minneapolis-city-council-candidate-guide-2025-election/601467349","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":null,"alt":null,"img2":null,"alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, Layercake, After Effects","tags":"design"},{"slug":"grandstand","featured":true,"headline":"Every State Fair Grandstand performance, visualized","dek":null,"date":"August 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/every-state-fair-grandstand-performance-visualized/601443934?utm_source=gift","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/grandstand-1.gif","alt":null,"img2":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/grandstand-2.png","alt2":null,"img3":null,"alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte, Illustrator, After Effects","tags":"graphics & data"},{"slug":"25in25","featured":true,"headline":"Minnesota’s top high school athletes of the past 25 years","dek":null,"date":"August 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/minnesotas-best-high-school-athletes-25-years-paige-bueckers-joe-mauer/601366476?utm_source=gift","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/25in25.png","alt":null,"img2":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/25in25-1.png","alt2":null,"img3":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6617e/public/img/25in25-2.png","alt3":null,"tools":"Svelte","tags":"design"},{"slug":"planting","featured":true,"headline":"Knee-high by Fourth of July: What grows in Minnesota and why","dek":null,"date":"July 2025","link":"https://www.startribune.com/what-growing-minnesota-crop-farm-field-corn-soybean-sugar-beet-food-animal-biofuel/601357336?utm_source=gift","publication":"The Minnesota Star Tribune","img":"https://github.com/elin001/portfolio/blob/a3bb4674ac47804baeaba495ffc7ef7260c6